      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mission_Canyon%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "State Route 192, known as Foothill Road, cuts through Mission Canyon’s southern part, while Mission Canyon Road runs north‑south.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
